HST Office: a double-click on an object opens its contextual ribbon tab (Slides, Draw, Sheets).

As in the familiar office suite, double-clicking a picture, shape, chart or table opens its Format tab
(Định dạng ảnh, Định dạng hình dạng, Thiết kế bảng...) on the Tabbed ribbon, before the double-click
starts text editing, activates a chart or OLE object, or opens a dialog. It calls
hst::ribbon::OpenContextualTab (include/vcl/HstRibbonContext.hxx, hst-ribbon-ux-engine.patch), which does
nothing without the Tabbed ribbon or when the selection shows no contextual tab.

- sd FuDraw::DoubleClick (Slides and Draw): one selected object.
- sc FuSelection::MouseButtonUp (Sheets): a double-click on the selected drawing object; cell editing is
  not involved.

